# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit the real file — .gitignore
# already covers .env and .env.*, and the key must never reach the browser.
#
# Get a key at https://platform.claude.com → API keys.
# Set a spending cap there too; a packing list costs about half a penny.
#
# The same variable goes in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables for the
# deployed site.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
